# The Dockerfile copies backend/ wholesale. Without this file the build context
# carried the live database (app.sqlite and its WAL, mid-write), every cover
# ever downloaded and the uploaded logos: megabytes shipped into the builder
# layer on every deploy, and since app.sqlite changes between deploys the COPY
# layer never cached, so the Pi recompiled every package each time.
.git
.backups
backend/data
**/*_test.go
*.md
scripts
*.cmd
